#: kwindecoration.cpp:100
msgid ""
"Select the window decoration. This is the look and feel of both the window "
"borders and the window handle."
msgstr ""
"Tchoezi l' gåyotaedje des purneas. Çouci est l' rivnance di, ambedeus, les "
"boirdeures des purneas eyet tot l' apougnaedje do purnea."

#: kwindecoration.cpp:105
msgid "Decoration Options"
msgstr "Tchuzes do gåyotaedje"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:115
msgid "B&order size:"
msgstr "Grandeu del b&oirdeure:"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:118
msgid "Use this combobox to change the border size of the decoration."
msgstr ""
"Si siervi di cisse djivêye di dressêye disrôlante po candjî l' grandeu del "
"boirdeure do gåyotaedje."

#: kwindecoration.cpp:135
msgid "&Show window button tooltips"
msgstr "&Håyner des racsegnes po les botons des purneas"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:137
msgid ""
"Enabling this checkbox will show window button tooltips. If this checkbox is "
"off, no window button tooltips will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Clitchî cisse boesse ci mosterrè des racsegnes po les botons des purneas "
"cwand vos passez dzeu avou l' sori. Si l' boesse est disclitcheye, nole "
"racsegne po les botons des purneas n' serè håynêye."

#: kwindecoration.cpp:141
msgid "Use custom titlebar button &positions"
msgstr "Eplaeçmints da &vosse po les botons del bår di tite"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:143
msgid ""
"The appropriate settings can be found in the \"Buttons\" Tab; please note "
"that this option is not available on all styles yet."
msgstr ""
"On sait trover les bounès tchuzes  el linwete « Botons »; notez s' i vs plait "
"ki cisse tchuze n' est nén co disponibe po tos les stîles."

